WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.549
Ashley Christian: So, 6 weeks in, my client

2
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:25.540
Ashley Christian: Six weeks in, my septic client is buying two new pump trucks. Today, we made their service area smaller. They're a septic company running Google, pay-per-click, and local service ads with a big budget.

3
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:34.490
Ashley Christian: In the same meeting where they told me they were buying two new pumping trucks, we pulled their service area closer, so the whole budget gets spent near home.

4
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:45.309
Ashley Christian: Spread a big budget across a big geographical area, and part of it pays for calls coming from places you don't actually want to drive to because of the cost of diesel.

5
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.340
Ashley Christian: Growth doesn't have to mean reaching further, it can mean winning more of the jobs closest to you.

6
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:57.880
Ashley Christian: If your ads keep ringing from the edge of your map, places you don't want to go, that's probably the first thing I'd look at.

